  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="price_clause">
        <p>Ego Iacobus de Tolomeis, sanus mente et corpore, relinquo ecclesiae Sancti Martini decem libras denariorum senensium, et Mariae uxori meae domum meam positam in contrada Sancti Petri, filiis vero meis Petro et Guidoni omnia bona mea mobilia et immobilia aequaliter dividenda.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="penalty_clause">
        <p>Si quis contra hanc meam ultimam voluntatem venire temptaverit, componat auri optimi libras centum, dimidia pars camerae communis Senarum et dimidia pars heredibus meis suprascriptis.</p>
      </div>
      <listWitness>
        <witness><name>Guido de Salimbenis</name></witness>
        <witness><name>Farinata de Malavoltis</name></witness>
        <witness><name>Ildebrandinus de Cacciacontis</name></witness>
        <witness><name>Bernardus de Pannocchieschis</name></witness>
      </listWitness>
    </body>
